		<item>
		<title>
		By: Madrine		</title>
		<link>https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/peri-operative-care/#comment-124</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Madrine]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 06 Apr 2023 15:46:07 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/?p=1410#comment-124</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Thank you so much for this, 
I still think Nurses roles can be included intraoperatively because they still have roles  to play while in the O.R.

Thanks again.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Thank you so much for this,<br />
I still think Nurses roles can be included intraoperatively because they still have roles  to play while in the O.R.</p>
<p>Thanks again.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>
		By: nursesrevision@gmail.com		</title>
		<link>https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/peri-operative-care/#comment-16</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[nursesrevision@gmail.com]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 08 Jan 2023 04:23:53 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/?p=1410#comment-16</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[In reply to &lt;a href=&quot;https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/peri-operative-care/#comment-15&quot;&gt;Muhire Paul&lt;/a&gt;.

Oh well, the only reason we didn&#039;t include that is because nurses roles stop after handing the patient over to theatre staff, that means the roles are taken over by the circulating and scrub nurse. Then the roles resume after surgery]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In reply to <a href="https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/peri-operative-care/#comment-15">Muhire Paul</a>.</p>
<p>Oh well, the only reason we didn&#8217;t include that is because nurses roles stop after handing the patient over to theatre staff, that means the roles are taken over by the circulating and scrub nurse. Then the roles resume after surgery</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>
		By: Muhire Paul		</title>
		<link>https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/peri-operative-care/#comment-15</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Muhire Paul]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 07 Jan 2023 17:33:21 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://nursesrevisionuganda.com/?p=1410#comment-15</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Thanks for the good content, I would wish to include the role of the nurse in intraoperative care]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Thanks for the good content, I would wish to include the role of the nurse in intraoperative care</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
